1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 33=

4
00:01:40,340 --> 00:01:40,660
Give it to me!

5
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:41,340
It's mine!

6
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:44,740
Hand it over!

7
00:01:45,980 --> 00:01:46,460
Give it back!

8
00:01:46,460 --> 00:01:47,460
Please, give me something to eat!

9
00:01:50,420 --> 00:01:51,100
Just a bite, please!

10
00:01:51,100 --> 00:01:51,620
No!

11
00:01:56,980 --> 00:01:57,660
Lost again?

12
00:01:57,900 --> 00:01:59,340
Go home and beat your old man again.

13
00:01:59,420 --> 00:02:01,220
Maybe he's still
hiding some burial money!

14
00:02:09,020 --> 00:02:09,700
Hurry up!

15
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:12,020
They're waiting to buy
your wife's body for burial.

16
00:02:12,420 --> 00:02:13,180
Miss the auspicious hour,

17
00:02:13,260 --> 00:02:14,260
and you won't even get this much!

18
00:02:16,980 --> 00:02:19,540
Selling his own wife's corpse...

19
00:02:20,740 --> 00:02:22,260
What a terrible thing!

20
00:02:23,780 --> 00:02:24,580
Three years.

21
00:02:27,260 --> 00:02:28,060
What did you say, sir?

22
00:02:31,460 --> 00:02:33,020
County magistrates are reassigned
every three years.

23
00:02:33,780 --> 00:02:34,300
By then,

24
00:02:35,180 --> 00:02:36,460
I may no longer be in Lanyang.

25
00:02:40,700 --> 00:02:42,060
Just bear with it, sir.

26
00:02:42,740 --> 00:02:44,700
Then you can move somewhere better.

27
00:02:45,540 --> 00:02:45,940
No.

28
00:02:47,220 --> 00:02:48,260
Three years from now,

29
00:02:49,340 --> 00:02:49,860
Lanyang

30
00:02:50,900 --> 00:02:52,100
must not still look like this.

31
00:02:53,820 --> 00:02:54,260
Mr. Han,

32
00:02:55,540 --> 00:02:55,940
let's go.

33
00:02:58,940 --> 00:02:59,620
I won't go!

34
00:02:59,620 --> 00:03:00,020
Move!

35
00:03:00,380 --> 00:03:01,580
- How am I supposed to feed you?
- I won't go!

36
00:03:01,820 --> 00:03:02,060
Go!

37
00:03:02,060 --> 00:03:03,340
Father, I don't want to go!

38
00:03:03,700 --> 00:03:04,540
- Behave yourself!
- Eighty coins.

39
00:03:04,660 --> 00:03:06,100
- I won't go!
- We agreed that settles the debt.

40
00:03:07,220 --> 00:03:08,260
Your father owes me a fortune in rent!

41
00:03:08,260 --> 00:03:08,540
No!

42
00:03:08,540 --> 00:03:08,900
Keep screaming,

43
00:03:09,340 --> 00:03:10,340
and I'll cook you in a pot!

44
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:11,460
I won't go!

45
00:03:11,860 --> 00:03:12,460
I won't go!

46
00:03:12,620 --> 00:03:13,020
I won't!

47
00:03:13,060 --> 00:03:13,860
Get lost!

48
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:15,780
Father!

49
00:03:16,180 --> 00:03:16,820
Father!

50
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:19,140
Father!

51
00:03:34,420 --> 00:03:35,060
Slow down.

52
00:03:35,500 --> 00:03:36,020
Eat slowly.

53
00:03:37,860 --> 00:03:42,740
(Donglang)

54
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:48,260
(Shendu Hall)
Sir,

55
00:03:48,780 --> 00:03:50,900
can you really not see anything at all?

56
00:03:55,300 --> 00:03:55,740
Donglang,

57
00:03:57,220 --> 00:03:58,460
would you be willing to be my eyes?

58
00:03:58,980 --> 00:03:59,620
How?

59
00:04:00,780 --> 00:04:01,420
Can you read?

60
00:04:02,220 --> 00:04:03,380
I've never been that lucky.

61
00:04:03,700 --> 00:04:05,540
Only a handful of families

62
00:04:05,660 --> 00:04:06,620
in Lanyang can read.

63
00:04:07,220 --> 00:04:08,980
Poor people stay poor forever.

64
00:04:10,340 --> 00:04:11,820
Reading won't change anything.

65
00:04:14,140 --> 00:04:14,900
That's not true.

66
00:04:15,980 --> 00:04:16,700
I can read,

67
00:04:17,460 --> 00:04:18,500
and that's how I was able to save you.

68
00:04:26,060 --> 00:04:27,180
Reading can save lives.

69
00:04:29,420 --> 00:04:30,580
It can save many lives.

70
00:04:36,420 --> 00:04:37,140
Then...

71
00:04:38,220 --> 00:04:39,260
could you teach me?

72
00:04:48,500 --> 00:04:49,220
Yang Si, you convicted criminal!

73
00:04:49,780 --> 00:04:50,300
Stop that!

74
00:04:50,940 --> 00:04:51,300
Come out!

75
00:05:12,220 --> 00:05:13,460
You're the one who ordered my release?

76
00:05:21,420 --> 00:05:21,980
Yang Si,

77
00:05:22,860 --> 00:05:23,540
it's good to see you again.

78
00:05:24,460 --> 00:05:24,980
What happened

79
00:05:25,700 --> 00:05:26,140
to His Majesty?

80
00:05:26,660 --> 00:05:27,860
His Majesty is unwell.

81
00:05:28,860 --> 00:05:29,700
He's suspended court to recuperate.

82
00:05:31,420 --> 00:05:32,900
I don't know how you managed it, Wanyao,

83
00:05:33,460 --> 00:05:34,660
but could you...

84
00:05:34,740 --> 00:05:35,180
No.

85
00:05:42,220 --> 00:05:42,980
Whatever happened,

86
00:05:44,420 --> 00:05:46,260
I did save you and Yan Shang that day

87
00:05:47,020 --> 00:05:48,260
and bring you both safely
back to Sheng'an,

88
00:05:48,940 --> 00:05:50,020
even though it led
to the Crown Prince's downfall.

89
00:05:51,340 --> 00:05:52,540
For the sake of that favor,

90
00:05:52,700 --> 00:05:53,860
could you release him from prison?

91
00:05:54,100 --> 00:05:54,780
A favor?

92
00:05:57,780 --> 00:05:59,740
Did my brother ever show me any mercy?

93
00:06:01,820 --> 00:06:03,860
When he sent Yu Niang to kill us,

94
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:05,620
he certainly showed none.

95
00:06:08,300 --> 00:06:08,940
Besides,

96
00:06:09,980 --> 00:06:11,580
he's the deposed Crown Prince now.

97
00:06:12,500 --> 00:06:14,060
Don't get his title wrong again.

98
00:06:17,740 --> 00:06:18,260
Yang Si.

99
00:06:19,020 --> 00:06:20,900
I haven't forgotten what you did
for me that day.

100
00:06:21,780 --> 00:06:22,540
That's why

101
00:06:23,100 --> 00:06:23,980
I granted you a special pardon today.

102
00:06:24,780 --> 00:06:26,180
But apparently,
that's not enough for you.

103
00:06:26,820 --> 00:06:27,860
You don't even seem grateful.

104
00:06:31,100 --> 00:06:31,540
Wanyao,

105
00:06:33,140 --> 00:06:34,220
I just want to ask you one thing.

106
00:06:36,180 --> 00:06:37,940
What are you going to do with Mu Xun?

107
00:06:39,700 --> 00:06:41,100
I'll have to give that some thought.

108
00:06:41,820 --> 00:06:42,420
Perhaps

109
00:06:43,020 --> 00:06:44,300
there's a precedent I could follow.

110
00:06:44,740 --> 00:06:46,260
You know full well
that no deposed Crown Prince

111
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:47,980
has ever survived more
than six months in this dynasty!

112
00:07:10,060 --> 00:07:10,700
I'm begging you.

113
00:07:12,020 --> 00:07:12,740
I, Yang Si,

114
00:07:13,540 --> 00:07:14,140
am begging you.

115
00:07:15,420 --> 00:07:16,180
Please don't let him die.

116
00:07:18,140 --> 00:07:19,260
The price will be steep.

117
00:07:20,860 --> 00:07:21,580
What do you want?

118
00:07:22,700 --> 00:07:23,420
Just name it.

119
00:07:23,660 --> 00:07:24,420
Anything within my power.

120
00:07:29,340 --> 00:07:29,860
I want you

121
00:07:33,860 --> 00:07:35,900
to give me yourself in exchange.

122
00:07:38,980 --> 00:07:39,460
Wanyao,

123
00:07:40,980 --> 00:07:42,820
you want me to die in his place?

124
00:07:44,500 --> 00:07:45,620
What would I want your life for?

125
00:07:47,340 --> 00:07:48,300
I want your freedom.

126
00:07:48,740 --> 00:07:50,620
Marry me and become
my prince consort, Yang Si.

127
00:07:54,580 --> 00:07:55,340
I don't understand.

128
00:07:55,540 --> 00:07:57,460
Why would you make a joke
of your own marriage?

129
00:07:58,820 --> 00:08:01,260
My marriage has always been a joke.

130
00:08:02,140 --> 00:08:03,020
But now,

131
00:08:03,780 --> 00:08:05,580
I'm no longer that frightened girl

132
00:08:05,900 --> 00:08:08,180
who lets imperial decrees
decide her fate.

133
00:08:09,580 --> 00:08:10,300
This time,

134
00:08:11,340 --> 00:08:13,180
I'll be the one telling the joke.

135
00:08:19,700 --> 00:08:22,020
What you really want is someone
to fill the role of prince consort.

136
00:08:22,300 --> 00:08:22,940
Exactly.

137
00:08:23,740 --> 00:08:25,340
As long as my marriage
remains undecided,

138
00:08:26,180 --> 00:08:26,980
the officials at court

139
00:08:27,260 --> 00:08:28,540
will keep arguing over it.

140
00:08:29,660 --> 00:08:30,500
My marriage

141
00:08:31,100 --> 00:08:32,620
will always be an excuse
to stir up trouble.

142
00:08:33,580 --> 00:08:34,580
I'm sick of it.

143
00:08:35,220 --> 00:08:36,380
I never want to hear them

144
00:08:36,380 --> 00:08:37,940
buzzing around like flies,

145
00:08:38,300 --> 00:08:39,180
using it to cause trouble again.

146
00:08:40,540 --> 00:08:43,260
So I'll have to put an end to it myself.

147
00:08:46,140 --> 00:08:46,860
Why me?

148
00:08:55,260 --> 00:08:56,500
Because I need someone

149
00:08:57,020 --> 00:08:59,260
from a noble family whom the court
can't object to.

150
00:09:01,340 --> 00:09:03,780
Someone I know inside and out.

151
00:09:05,260 --> 00:09:06,580
Someone who'll do as he's told.

152
00:09:09,700 --> 00:09:10,300
Yang Si,

153
00:09:11,780 --> 00:09:12,900
will you be that man?

154
00:09:22,300 --> 00:09:22,980
(Stop running!)

155
00:09:25,620 --> 00:09:26,180
(Mu Wanyao,)

156
00:09:26,700 --> 00:09:27,780
(you're playing the bride.)

157
00:09:28,580 --> 00:09:30,220
(How can a bride not have a flower
in her hair?)

158
00:09:30,700 --> 00:09:31,020
(Here.)

159
00:09:34,700 --> 00:09:35,300
(How pretty!)

160
00:09:46,420 --> 00:09:46,900
All right.

161
00:09:50,220 --> 00:09:50,940
I agree.

162
00:09:53,900 --> 00:09:54,460
Yang Si,

163
00:09:57,540 --> 00:09:59,260
do you know what makes

164
00:10:01,100 --> 00:10:02,060
a suitable prince consort?

165
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:03,780
Harmless.

166
00:10:06,140 --> 00:10:06,740
Inactive.

167
00:10:08,420 --> 00:10:09,020
And powerless.

168
00:10:16,980 --> 00:10:17,700
And I promise you

169
00:10:19,220 --> 00:10:20,180
I'll keep Mu Xun alive.

170
00:10:23,540 --> 00:10:24,660
(As long as it's not him,)

171
00:10:26,900 --> 00:10:28,020
(anyone else will do.)

172
00:10:29,140 --> 00:10:29,740
(Right?)

173
00:11:07,820 --> 00:11:08,780
What time is it?

174
00:11:09,740 --> 00:11:10,260
Your Highness,

175
00:11:10,860 --> 00:11:11,860
it's near the hour of Xu.

176
00:11:12,940 --> 00:11:13,940
You should get some rest.

177
00:11:14,580 --> 00:11:16,060
Come and dress me
in the third quarter of the Mao hour.

178
00:11:16,500 --> 00:11:18,220
I must meet several ministers
early tomorrow morning.

179
00:11:18,500 --> 00:11:19,700
You're not going to sleep again?

180
00:11:39,660 --> 00:11:40,140
Minister Wang,

181
00:11:40,620 --> 00:11:41,900
do you have any idea

182
00:11:41,900 --> 00:11:42,860
what the people of Huai
are going through?

183
00:11:42,860 --> 00:11:44,540
We have hundreds of thousands
of troops on the frontier!

184
00:11:44,660 --> 00:11:46,660
Without their pay, morale will collapse!

185
00:11:46,660 --> 00:11:48,340
(Wang Cong, Minister of War)
How are they supposed to fight?

186
00:11:49,180 --> 00:11:50,780
(Jiang Hua, Minister of Revenue)
Empty or not, we must find a way.

187
00:11:50,860 --> 00:11:51,660
Your Highness,

188
00:11:51,940 --> 00:11:53,820
(Universe in Harmony)
years of unrest caused

189
00:11:54,100 --> 00:11:56,300
by military governors and Yu's faction
have pushed the people to their limits.

190
00:11:56,780 --> 00:11:58,900
If we raise taxes again
to fund the army,

191
00:11:59,220 --> 00:12:00,580
we risk a popular uprising!

192
00:12:00,860 --> 00:12:01,580
Without raising taxes,

193
00:12:02,540 --> 00:12:04,740
where will next year's military funds
come from?

194
00:12:05,140 --> 00:12:06,020
Raise taxes?

195
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:08,740
Who said anything about raising taxes?

196
00:12:09,820 --> 00:12:10,820
Excessive taxation

197
00:12:11,580 --> 00:12:12,580
only breeds resentment.

198
00:12:13,260 --> 00:12:14,260
That's no way to govern.

199
00:12:16,060 --> 00:12:17,100
I have a proposal

200
00:12:17,460 --> 00:12:18,380
that could solve this problem.

201
00:12:20,020 --> 00:12:20,940
Let the army farm its own food.

202
00:12:22,180 --> 00:12:22,780
Gentlemen,

203
00:12:23,340 --> 00:12:24,140
what do you think?

204
00:12:25,220 --> 00:12:25,780
Your Highness,

205
00:12:26,700 --> 00:12:29,860
where could we find enough unused land
for the troops to farm?

206
00:12:31,140 --> 00:12:31,580
Exactly!

207
00:12:31,820 --> 00:12:32,260
That's right!

208
00:12:33,020 --> 00:12:34,620
(Universe in Harmony)

209
00:12:34,620 --> 00:12:35,340
Right!

210
00:12:40,220 --> 00:12:41,060
The estates confiscated from officials

211
00:12:41,580 --> 00:12:43,900
implicated in the former
Crown Prince's case,

212
00:12:44,820 --> 00:12:45,780
and the lands seized around the capital

213
00:12:46,460 --> 00:12:48,620
by Yu Cheng'an over the years,

214
00:12:49,140 --> 00:12:50,340
I've ordered them all surveyed

215
00:12:51,060 --> 00:12:52,660
and allocated for military farming.

216
00:12:53,500 --> 00:12:55,020
That's 900,000 mu of fertile land.

217
00:12:55,660 --> 00:12:56,380
How can you say there's no land?

218
00:12:58,740 --> 00:12:59,820
Of everything the military
farms produce,

219
00:13:00,380 --> 00:13:02,140
ten percent will go to the treasury

220
00:13:02,780 --> 00:13:04,540
to fund weapons, bows, and horses.

221
00:13:05,340 --> 00:13:05,900
Another ten percent

222
00:13:06,420 --> 00:13:08,340
will improve the soldiers' food
and clothing.

223
00:13:09,020 --> 00:13:09,620
And ten percent

224
00:13:10,420 --> 00:13:12,220
will go to the families
of the farming soldiers.

225
00:13:13,460 --> 00:13:15,020
I want these soldiers

226
00:13:15,420 --> 00:13:16,980
to be well fed and warmly clothed,

227
00:13:17,660 --> 00:13:18,540
with enough food for their families,

228
00:13:18,940 --> 00:13:20,060
so they know who they're fighting for.

229
00:13:24,020 --> 00:13:25,020
Your Highness, this plan

230
00:13:25,420 --> 00:13:26,540
will benefit both the throne
and the nation.

231
00:13:26,860 --> 00:13:28,100
It's an excellent proposal!

232
00:13:28,500 --> 00:13:29,300
I haven't finished.

233
00:13:31,740 --> 00:13:32,220
Wang Cong.

234
00:13:33,460 --> 00:13:34,060
Yes, Your Highness?

235
00:13:34,540 --> 00:13:35,340
As Minister of War,

236
00:13:35,980 --> 00:13:37,580
you'll oversee this plan.

237
00:13:38,660 --> 00:13:39,900
The Censorate and Jinwu Guards

238
00:13:40,460 --> 00:13:41,380
will assist with supervision.

239
00:13:42,300 --> 00:13:43,220
If anything goes wrong,

240
00:13:44,020 --> 00:13:44,860
you'll answer for it.

241
00:13:45,300 --> 00:13:47,260
I'll do everything in my power

242
00:13:47,420 --> 00:13:48,620
to live up to Your Highness's trust!

243
00:13:49,180 --> 00:13:51,460
We won't let Your Highness down!

244
00:14:22,020 --> 00:14:22,700
What are you doing here?

245
00:14:22,980 --> 00:14:23,780
There are two things

246
00:14:24,180 --> 00:14:26,060
I'd like to present
to Your Highness personally.

247
00:14:31,180 --> 00:14:32,860
His Majesty was kind enough
to entrust me

248
00:14:33,580 --> 00:14:35,140
with the Shence Army's command tally.

249
00:14:35,820 --> 00:14:37,060
I've always felt unworthy of the honor.

250
00:14:37,460 --> 00:14:39,380
Now that Your Highness

251
00:14:39,660 --> 00:14:40,540
governs under Heaven's mandate,

252
00:14:41,780 --> 00:14:44,300
I humbly ask Your Highness
to take back this tally

253
00:14:44,620 --> 00:14:45,540
to ensure the army's loyalty.

254
00:14:48,260 --> 00:14:49,220
(Shence Army)

255
00:14:52,380 --> 00:14:53,180
With your abilities,

256
00:14:53,860 --> 00:14:55,180
you could have a dozen of these

257
00:14:55,620 --> 00:14:56,820
and still couldn't command
the Shence Army.

258
00:14:58,180 --> 00:14:59,460
Father knew that perfectly well.

259
00:15:00,460 --> 00:15:01,700
That's why he gave it to you.

260
00:15:04,980 --> 00:15:06,700
Your Highness is absolutely right.

261
00:15:07,580 --> 00:15:07,900
Your Highness,

262
00:15:08,420 --> 00:15:09,140
there's also this.

263
00:15:11,940 --> 00:15:12,700
And what's this?

264
00:15:13,380 --> 00:15:14,340
When I worked in the Imperial
Cuisine Service,

265
00:15:14,980 --> 00:15:17,020
I heard you were fond of chilled
lychee wine.

266
00:15:17,740 --> 00:15:18,780
It's hard to find in Sheng'an,

267
00:15:19,220 --> 00:15:21,020
so I brought some especially for you.

268
00:15:30,460 --> 00:15:30,980
Come to think of it,

269
00:15:31,500 --> 00:15:33,820
if not for your help and Yan Shang's,

270
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:36,620
I'd never have entered the palace
and built a career.

271
00:15:37,100 --> 00:15:39,340
I might have died somewhere long ago.

272
00:15:42,740 --> 00:15:44,100
When I first joined
the Imperial Cuisine Service,

273
00:15:44,460 --> 00:15:46,780
I carried this food box every day.

274
00:15:47,380 --> 00:15:49,580
I keep it in my office now

275
00:15:49,980 --> 00:15:51,260
to remind myself where I came from,

276
00:15:51,620 --> 00:15:51,980
and never forget

277
00:15:52,500 --> 00:15:53,220
the kindness I received.

278
00:15:56,820 --> 00:15:57,780
How thoughtful of you.

279
00:15:59,540 --> 00:16:00,700
But it sounds to me

280
00:16:01,500 --> 00:16:02,660
like you have more to say.

281
00:16:07,380 --> 00:16:08,740
Ever since I entered the palace,

282
00:16:09,180 --> 00:16:10,580
I've never had the chance
to serve Your Highness directly.

283
00:16:10,820 --> 00:16:11,860
I deeply regret that.

284
00:16:12,500 --> 00:16:12,940
However,

285
00:16:13,580 --> 00:16:15,140
through all the recent turmoil,

286
00:16:15,460 --> 00:16:16,940
I've done what little I could.

287
00:16:17,540 --> 00:16:18,060
I'm sure

288
00:16:18,820 --> 00:16:20,140
Your Highness is already aware of that.

289
00:16:21,300 --> 00:16:22,220
So I humbly ask

290
00:16:22,420 --> 00:16:23,460
for Your Highness's favor.

291
00:16:23,780 --> 00:16:25,940
Please allow me to serve you personally

292
00:16:26,100 --> 00:16:26,900
and repay even a fraction
of your kindness.

293
00:16:30,340 --> 00:16:31,140
As it happens,

294
00:16:31,900 --> 00:16:33,180
I do have something for you to do.

295
00:16:37,580 --> 00:16:38,420
Now that you've been relieved

296
00:16:38,420 --> 00:16:39,820
of your duties with the Shence Army,

297
00:16:40,860 --> 00:16:41,780
you can

298
00:16:42,260 --> 00:16:44,660
devote all your attention
to the inner palace

299
00:16:45,580 --> 00:16:46,980
and take good care of His Majesty.

300
00:16:54,900 --> 00:16:55,260
As you command.

301
00:16:58,940 --> 00:16:59,900
I'm counting on you, Mr. Liu.

302
00:17:01,580 --> 00:17:02,940
Since you'll be caring for my father
on my behalf,

303
00:17:03,780 --> 00:17:04,380
your monthly salary

304
00:17:05,020 --> 00:17:05,780
will naturally be doubled.

305
00:17:20,380 --> 00:17:20,900
Thank you, Your Highness.

306
00:17:37,380 --> 00:17:38,020
(Liu Wenji,)

307
00:17:39,020 --> 00:17:39,700
(I was willing)

308
00:17:39,700 --> 00:17:41,180
(to give you a chance
to make something of yourself.)

309
00:17:42,460 --> 00:17:44,340
(But I fear even you haven't realized)

310
00:17:45,340 --> 00:17:46,220
(how much)

311
00:17:47,100 --> 00:17:47,980
(you've changed.)

312
00:18:18,220 --> 00:18:18,860
Mr. Liu.

313
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:22,700
How is His Majesty?

314
00:18:24,780 --> 00:18:26,100
His Majesty is getting better.

315
00:18:26,660 --> 00:18:29,460
He's staying awake much longer
than before.

316
00:18:29,820 --> 00:18:32,620
And we've finally managed
to give him some medicine.

317
00:18:35,340 --> 00:18:36,420
You should get some rest.

318
00:18:37,100 --> 00:18:37,620
Thank you.

319
00:18:55,380 --> 00:18:56,540
Shou'en...

320
00:18:58,100 --> 00:18:58,740
Shou'en...

321
00:19:03,540 --> 00:19:04,140
My arm's numb.

322
00:19:05,940 --> 00:19:06,260
Your Majesty.

323
00:19:07,420 --> 00:19:08,220
Feeling better now?

324
00:19:15,140 --> 00:19:15,540
Your Majesty.

325
00:19:17,700 --> 00:19:18,540
It's you.

326
00:19:19,420 --> 00:19:20,060
Yes, Your Majesty.

327
00:19:21,460 --> 00:19:22,820
What are you doing here?

328
00:19:23,700 --> 00:19:24,020
Your Majesty,

329
00:19:24,940 --> 00:19:26,660
you gave me the chance
to rise in the palace.

330
00:19:27,140 --> 00:19:28,300
I'll never forget your kindness.

331
00:19:28,940 --> 00:19:29,460
Now,

332
00:19:29,980 --> 00:19:31,260
I've volunteered to care for you.

333
00:19:31,620 --> 00:19:32,380
I only hope

334
00:19:33,300 --> 00:19:34,860
Your Majesty won't turn me away.

335
00:19:46,340 --> 00:19:47,020
Very good.

336
00:20:38,900 --> 00:20:39,940
The plum blossoms in Sheng'an

337
00:20:41,580 --> 00:20:42,860
have the same fragrance.

338
00:20:54,540 --> 00:20:56,700
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

339
00:20:56,700 --> 00:20:57,860
Your Highness! Your Highness!

340
00:20:57,860 --> 00:20:58,420
Please read my writings!

341
00:20:58,420 --> 00:20:58,860
Read mine!

342
00:20:58,860 --> 00:20:59,220
Stand back!

343
00:20:59,660 --> 00:21:00,300
Make way up front!

344
00:21:00,460 --> 00:21:00,780
Your Highness!

345
00:21:00,900 --> 00:21:01,340
Stand back!

346
00:21:01,660 --> 00:21:02,100
Get back!

347
00:21:02,540 --> 00:21:03,300
Please read my writings!

348
00:21:03,420 --> 00:21:03,780
Your Highness!

349
00:21:03,780 --> 00:21:04,420
Here's mine!

350
00:21:05,380 --> 00:21:06,020
And mine!

351
00:21:06,020 --> 00:21:06,500
Your Highness!

352
00:21:06,500 --> 00:21:07,180
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

353
00:21:07,340 --> 00:21:07,860
Stand back!

354
00:21:08,580 --> 00:21:09,100
Move aside!

355
00:21:09,100 --> 00:21:09,580
Here's mine!

356
00:21:09,580 --> 00:21:10,540
And mine!

357
00:21:10,540 --> 00:21:11,700
- Get out of my way!
- I was here first!

358
00:21:11,700 --> 00:21:12,660
Your Highness! Your Highness!

359
00:21:12,660 --> 00:21:13,100
Stand back!

360
00:21:13,260 --> 00:21:13,900
Here's mine!

361
00:21:14,140 --> 00:21:14,700
Get back!

362
00:21:16,580 --> 00:21:17,380
Your Highness, just take a look!

363
00:21:17,460 --> 00:21:18,180
(My essays fall short,)
Please read mine!

364
00:21:18,180 --> 00:21:18,780
(but follow Han Yu's ideals.)
Get back!

365
00:21:18,780 --> 00:21:19,780
(Respectfully submitted by Wu Liu,
a humble student from Lanyang.)

366
00:21:19,780 --> 00:21:20,660
Here's mine, Your Highness!

367
00:21:20,660 --> 00:21:21,580
These are my writings!
Please take a look!

368
00:21:21,580 --> 00:21:22,220
Read mine first!

369
00:21:23,220 --> 00:21:24,020
Who's Wu Liu?

370
00:21:24,380 --> 00:21:25,860
Me! That's me, Your Highness!

371
00:21:26,820 --> 00:21:28,180
When did you leave your hometown?

372
00:21:29,020 --> 00:21:30,180
How are things there?

373
00:21:30,900 --> 00:21:31,460
I...

374
00:21:31,820 --> 00:21:33,260
I arrived in Sheng'an just
three days ago.

375
00:21:33,540 --> 00:21:35,420
I never dreamed I'd be lucky enough
to meet Your Highness.

376
00:21:35,860 --> 00:21:37,060
I'm from Lanyang,

377
00:21:37,660 --> 00:21:39,340
a poor, remote little place.

378
00:21:39,860 --> 00:21:41,820
What do people think of your
new county magistrate?

379
00:21:42,340 --> 00:21:44,020
If our magistrate hadn't helped
pay my way,

380
00:21:44,180 --> 00:21:45,380
I'd never have made it to Sheng'an.

381
00:21:46,300 --> 00:21:47,060
You know him?

382
00:21:47,740 --> 00:21:48,900
In our little town of Lanyang,

383
00:21:49,180 --> 00:21:50,100
every single person

384
00:21:50,260 --> 00:21:51,380
knows Magistrate Yan.

385
00:21:51,860 --> 00:21:54,060
Does Your Highness know
Magistrate Yan too?

386
00:21:59,100 --> 00:22:00,820
Your Highness! Please take mine too!

387
00:22:08,340 --> 00:22:10,660
Maybe the princess really does know
Magistrate Yan.

388
00:22:10,980 --> 00:22:12,900
I heard he placed third
in the imperial examinations.

389
00:22:13,340 --> 00:22:14,780
Your Highness! Your Highness!

390
00:22:14,860 --> 00:22:16,060
A letter from Wei Shu.

391
00:22:16,820 --> 00:22:18,180
Dear Yan Shang,

392
00:22:18,860 --> 00:22:20,020
it's been years since we parted,

393
00:22:20,380 --> 00:22:21,740
and I miss you more
with each passing day.

394
00:22:22,660 --> 00:22:24,980
I hear you've helped restore the throne,

395
00:22:25,220 --> 00:22:26,420
devoting all your strength to the cause.

396
00:22:27,540 --> 00:22:29,900
Your plans were loyal and fair.

397
00:22:30,540 --> 00:22:32,740
Your sincerity was selfless.

398
00:22:33,180 --> 00:22:34,540
Respectfully yours, Wei Shu.

399
00:22:37,580 --> 00:22:39,540
It's "Your counsel was loyal and sound,

400
00:22:40,140 --> 00:22:41,620
and your devotion truly selfless."

401
00:22:42,980 --> 00:22:43,420
Just one sentence.

402
00:22:43,940 --> 00:22:44,980
Count how many characters you got wrong.

403
00:22:45,500 --> 00:22:46,660
You've been so busy lately.

404
00:22:46,820 --> 00:22:48,180
You haven't taught me
those characters yet.

405
00:22:48,580 --> 00:22:49,740
Of course I don't know them.

406
00:22:50,300 --> 00:22:52,460
Now the student is blaming his teacher?

407
00:22:54,940 --> 00:22:55,340
Well?

408
00:22:56,060 --> 00:22:56,500
Are you finished?

409
00:22:57,620 --> 00:22:58,540
There's another letter.

410
00:23:04,660 --> 00:23:06,060
Dear Yan Shang,

411
00:23:06,860 --> 00:23:08,780
though mountains and passes separate us,

412
00:23:09,380 --> 00:23:11,300
whenever I see the palace lychees
ripening red

413
00:23:11,540 --> 00:23:12,580
or hear the roosters crow at dawn,

414
00:23:13,180 --> 00:23:16,020
I almost hear the woodcutters
calling through Lingnan's hills.

415
00:23:17,180 --> 00:23:18,460
Respectfully yours, Liu Wenji.

416
00:23:19,180 --> 00:23:19,620
Sir,

417
00:23:20,060 --> 00:23:22,180
this one's from Liu Wenji
in Sheng'an again.

418
00:23:23,660 --> 00:23:24,820
This month,

419
00:23:25,260 --> 00:23:28,020
Mr. Wei sent two letters.

420
00:23:29,740 --> 00:23:31,020
Mr. Liu

421
00:23:31,620 --> 00:23:32,300
sent five.

422
00:23:33,380 --> 00:23:35,060
Sir, are you still not going to reply?

423
00:23:38,020 --> 00:23:38,700
Why not?

424
00:23:39,140 --> 00:23:41,460
I may not understand everything,

425
00:23:42,020 --> 00:23:43,180
but I can tell

426
00:23:43,500 --> 00:23:45,540
they're both very dear friends of yours.

427
00:23:46,300 --> 00:23:48,340
They keep sending letters.

428
00:23:48,540 --> 00:23:50,220
They must really want to know
how you're doing.

429
00:23:53,060 --> 00:23:54,140
They're both government officials,

430
00:23:54,580 --> 00:23:55,380
serving in the capital,

431
00:23:56,020 --> 00:23:57,140
where they're surrounded by informants.

432
00:23:58,420 --> 00:24:00,580
I was sent to a county post in disgrace.

433
00:24:01,140 --> 00:24:01,820
Given my situation,

434
00:24:02,540 --> 00:24:03,620
it's best I don't contact them.

435
00:24:06,860 --> 00:24:09,500
But if they never hear back from you,

436
00:24:09,820 --> 00:24:11,260
won't your friends be sad?

437
00:24:13,660 --> 00:24:14,660
If they didn't understand,

438
00:24:15,460 --> 00:24:17,140
why would they keep writing?

439
00:24:40,340 --> 00:24:45,260
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

440
00:24:47,420 --> 00:24:52,660
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

441
00:24:54,900 --> 00:25:00,980
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

442
00:25:01,220 --> 00:25:06,740
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

443
00:25:06,740 --> 00:25:09,180
(Universe in Harmony)

444
00:25:09,180 --> 00:25:14,460
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

445
00:25:14,620 --> 00:25:21,300
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- Let grief drown in your eyes♪

446
00:25:22,740 --> 00:25:25,680
♪- Soar with the wind;
- Plunge into hellfire as one♪

447
00:25:25,680 --> 00:25:27,580
♪Burning bright as a song♪

448
00:25:27,620 --> 00:25:31,220
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

449
00:25:31,340 --> 00:25:36,340
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪
(Charity School)

450
00:25:38,980 --> 00:25:39,340
Donglang,

451
00:25:40,460 --> 00:25:41,620
what do their faces look like?

452
00:25:41,620 --> 00:25:42,860
♪Not a single hour less♪

453
00:25:42,860 --> 00:25:44,340
Everyone's smiling from ear to ear!

454
00:25:44,940 --> 00:25:47,260
The children keep saying,
"We can go to school now!"

455
00:25:47,460 --> 00:25:48,540
They're running around you.

456
00:25:51,060 --> 00:25:54,500
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

457
00:25:54,940 --> 00:25:57,620
In the past, candidates sought
favor by presenting their writings.

458
00:25:58,460 --> 00:25:59,980
Scholars flocked to the homes
of the powerful,

459
00:26:00,500 --> 00:26:02,220
and family connections often
mattered more than merit.

460
00:26:03,220 --> 00:26:05,060
But thanks to Her Highness's
wisdom and compassion,

461
00:26:05,500 --> 00:26:06,420
these long-standing abuses
have been exposed.

462
00:26:06,780 --> 00:26:07,620
From now on,

463
00:26:08,100 --> 00:26:09,060
the imperial examinations

464
00:26:09,700 --> 00:26:10,500
will use anonymous, recopied scripts,

465
00:26:11,020 --> 00:26:13,380
so candidates will no longer depend
on endorsements from the powerful.

466
00:26:14,580 --> 00:26:14,900
Sir,

467
00:26:15,500 --> 00:26:17,380
did I get everything right this time?

468
00:26:19,780 --> 00:26:21,540
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

469
00:26:21,540 --> 00:26:22,620
But...

470
00:26:23,100 --> 00:26:24,820
What exactly

471
00:26:25,580 --> 00:26:26,740
does Mr. Wei's letter mean?

472
00:26:26,780 --> 00:26:30,220
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

473
00:26:30,500 --> 00:26:31,140
It means

474
00:26:31,940 --> 00:26:32,460
that someday,

475
00:26:33,060 --> 00:26:34,380
children like you

476
00:26:35,220 --> 00:26:36,940
will have more opportunities in life.

477
00:26:36,940 --> 00:26:41,000
♪Just us, through dawn and dusk♪

478
00:26:41,100 --> 00:26:42,980
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

479
00:26:42,980 --> 00:26:45,620
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn
- May time be free of pain♪

480
00:26:45,780 --> 00:26:48,340
♪You're the only one I need♪

481
00:26:48,340 --> 00:26:52,020
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

482
00:26:52,020 --> 00:26:55,500
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

483
00:26:55,540 --> 00:26:58,940
♪- Till fireworks flood the town;
- Till the lake is still and clear♪

484
00:26:58,980 --> 00:27:01,620
♪The wind blows past us♪

485
00:27:01,620 --> 00:27:03,262
(Three years later,
25th year of Yingxiang)

486
00:27:03,262 --> 00:27:05,020
(Severe drought,
especially in Hannan Circuit)

487
00:27:05,140 --> 00:27:07,560
(The disaster is worse than ever.
Please inform His Majesty at once.)

488
00:27:07,560 --> 00:27:10,090
(Release 300,000 shi of imperial grain.
Order Jianghuai to send aid.)

489
00:27:10,090 --> 00:27:12,420
(Delay until late autumn risks unrest.
Cui Mujin, Inspector of Monan Circuit.)

490
00:27:14,860 --> 00:27:19,060
(Universe in Harmony)

491
00:27:33,340 --> 00:27:34,340
Hot springs at Mount Li?

492
00:27:34,700 --> 00:27:35,020
Yes.

493
00:27:35,540 --> 00:27:36,500
(Wang Min, Palace's Deputy Director)
As in previous years,

494
00:27:36,740 --> 00:27:39,100
we've prepared the plans for palace
provisions, escorts, and carriages.

495
00:27:39,620 --> 00:27:40,980
We await Your Highness's approval.

496
00:27:44,580 --> 00:27:45,420
Do you have any idea what's happening?

497
00:27:46,260 --> 00:27:47,820
The people can't even find
a mouthful of dirty water!

498
00:27:48,660 --> 00:27:51,180
And you want me to take the royal family
to Mount Li?

499
00:27:52,220 --> 00:27:53,500
Bring me another proposal
so out of touch

500
00:27:53,820 --> 00:27:55,260
and so indifferent
to the people's suffering,

501
00:27:55,860 --> 00:27:57,140
and you'll lose your position
in the Palace Administration!

502
00:27:57,820 --> 00:27:59,860
I happen to need someone
to send to Hannan Circuit.

503
00:28:05,180 --> 00:28:05,500
Come back!

504
00:28:08,940 --> 00:28:10,700
Cut all palace expenses in half.

505
00:28:11,260 --> 00:28:11,780
Immediately have

506
00:28:12,300 --> 00:28:13,900
the Palace Administration
draft a detailed plan

507
00:28:14,380 --> 00:28:14,980
and report back the day after tomorrow.

508
00:28:16,140 --> 00:28:16,540
And another thing.

509
00:28:17,140 --> 00:28:17,780
Effective immediately,

510
00:28:18,140 --> 00:28:19,380
cancel all banquets, entertainments,
and hunting trips.

511
00:28:19,980 --> 00:28:21,220
Disaster relief and the people's
welfare come first.

512
00:28:21,820 --> 00:28:22,140
Yes, Your Highness.

513
00:28:22,900 --> 00:28:23,300
Yes, Your Highness.

514
00:28:31,740 --> 00:28:34,660
(Universe in Harmony)

515
00:28:34,660 --> 00:28:35,620
Your Highness.

516
00:28:36,860 --> 00:28:39,020
The affected prefectures
have followed your orders,

517
00:28:39,100 --> 00:28:40,900
opening granaries and distributing food
and medicine,

518
00:28:41,180 --> 00:28:42,900
and severely punishing hoarders
and profiteers.

519
00:28:44,300 --> 00:28:47,220
But with no rain, rivers and lakes
have dried up.

520
00:28:47,500 --> 00:28:48,580
Relief aid alone

521
00:28:49,100 --> 00:28:50,420
won't sustain them much longer.

522
00:28:52,140 --> 00:28:53,100
Are you saying

523
00:28:54,380 --> 00:28:55,260
all we can do is wait for rain?

524
00:28:57,260 --> 00:28:59,380
There are limits to what we can do.

525
00:29:00,100 --> 00:29:01,940
To truly put an end to this disaster,

526
00:29:02,700 --> 00:29:03,580
we must wait for rain.

527
00:29:07,540 --> 00:29:09,660
(Any delay until late autumn may
cause unrest.)

528
00:29:09,660 --> 00:29:10,180
Your Highness,

529
00:29:11,300 --> 00:29:12,500
never in history

530
00:29:12,780 --> 00:29:18,260
has a regent personally ventured
into such danger.

531
00:29:18,780 --> 00:29:19,620
If there's no precedent,

532
00:29:20,460 --> 00:29:21,180
then I

533
00:29:21,860 --> 00:29:23,100
shall set one.

534
00:29:33,180 --> 00:29:34,820
You think I'm being reckless,

535
00:29:35,700 --> 00:29:36,060
don't you?

536
00:29:37,780 --> 00:29:39,260
You're all concerned about my safety,

537
00:29:39,740 --> 00:29:42,220
yet none of you seem concerned
about the failed relief efforts

538
00:29:42,780 --> 00:29:43,660
and false reports across the empire.

539
00:29:44,860 --> 00:29:45,540
I had no idea

540
00:29:46,420 --> 00:29:47,700
that being Princess Regent

541
00:29:48,420 --> 00:29:49,700
meant living comfortably

542
00:29:50,780 --> 00:29:52,340
without taking the slightest risk.

543
00:29:54,780 --> 00:29:55,700
And remember this.

544
00:29:56,620 --> 00:29:57,140
From now on,

545
00:29:58,220 --> 00:29:59,820
anyone who cares only
about personal safety

546
00:30:00,460 --> 00:30:01,620
and enjoying palace luxuries

547
00:30:02,580 --> 00:30:04,020
is unfit to govern the realm,

548
00:30:04,820 --> 00:30:06,100
much less bear responsibility
for the nation!

549
00:30:10,220 --> 00:30:11,140
I am

550
00:30:12,180 --> 00:30:12,940
ashamed, Your Highness.

551
00:30:13,540 --> 00:30:15,340
We are ashamed, Your Highness!

552
00:30:26,260 --> 00:30:26,900
None of these will do!

553
00:30:27,060 --> 00:30:27,980
You there, come with me.

554
00:30:32,620 --> 00:30:33,260
Fang Tong?

555
00:30:37,780 --> 00:30:38,140
Your Highness.

556
00:30:39,220 --> 00:30:40,020
Why are you back?

557
00:30:41,140 --> 00:30:42,700
I heard you were going
on a long journey,

558
00:30:42,980 --> 00:30:44,140
so of course I cut my leave short
and came back.

559
00:30:44,420 --> 00:30:44,900
Don't be ridiculous!

560
00:30:46,500 --> 00:30:47,060
Go back home!

561
00:30:47,580 --> 00:30:48,300
I'm not going.

562
00:30:49,300 --> 00:30:50,500
Does Your Highness not want me
around anymore?

563
00:30:50,820 --> 00:30:52,780
You're going so far away
without taking me.

564
00:30:53,540 --> 00:30:55,060
Your wife only just gave birth.

565
00:30:58,460 --> 00:30:59,500
It's almost been a month.

566
00:31:00,100 --> 00:31:00,620
Besides,

567
00:31:01,020 --> 00:31:02,300
she urged me to come back too.
She said...

568
00:31:02,300 --> 00:31:02,660
Enough!

569
00:31:03,940 --> 00:31:04,540
You're not coming.

570
00:31:05,180 --> 00:31:06,140
Get back home right now.

571
00:31:06,660 --> 00:31:07,100
I can't do that.

572
00:31:07,620 --> 00:31:08,220
I'd be too worried.

573
00:31:08,940 --> 00:31:09,860
You're traveling

574
00:31:10,180 --> 00:31:11,100
in disguise again,

575
00:31:11,340 --> 00:31:12,220
and it's dangerous out there.

576
00:31:12,700 --> 00:31:14,700
Who's going to protect you
if I don't come?

577
00:31:15,620 --> 00:31:16,620
I've already chosen someone.

578
00:31:37,940 --> 00:31:38,740
Why are you zoning out?

579
00:31:39,380 --> 00:31:40,060
It's out of ink.

580
00:31:42,700 --> 00:31:43,340
I was counting.

581
00:31:44,820 --> 00:31:47,460
Over the past two months, across all
the disaster-stricken prefectures,

582
00:31:48,500 --> 00:31:49,300
you've had one official executed,

583
00:31:50,100 --> 00:31:50,820
dismissed three others,

584
00:31:51,820 --> 00:31:53,580
and punished the corrupt officials
who deserved it.

585
00:31:54,460 --> 00:31:55,500
The relief funds and grain

586
00:31:56,380 --> 00:31:57,860
have finally reached the people
who need them.

587
00:31:58,980 --> 00:32:00,020
Now, on this final leg,

588
00:32:00,820 --> 00:32:02,140
I just hope we won't run
into any more trouble.

589
00:32:03,540 --> 00:32:05,740
I have you to thank for protecting me
so well, Yang Si.

590
00:32:06,420 --> 00:32:08,580
You haven't let anyone discover
my identity.

591
00:32:15,860 --> 00:32:16,300
Wanyao,

592
00:32:17,220 --> 00:32:18,100
you've really changed a lot.

593
00:32:19,220 --> 00:32:20,700
So have you, Yang Si.

594
00:32:24,220 --> 00:32:24,940
These past two months,

595
00:32:25,500 --> 00:32:26,260
I've been bounced around
until my bones ache.

596
00:32:26,900 --> 00:32:27,900
I'm completely exhausted.

597
00:32:28,940 --> 00:32:30,180
But I've actually enjoyed myself.

598
00:32:30,500 --> 00:32:32,820
More than being
a carefree prince consort?

599
00:32:33,580 --> 00:32:34,780
Being a prince consort is fun too.

600
00:32:36,780 --> 00:32:38,020
Three years as Prince Consort,

601
00:32:38,780 --> 00:32:40,100
and I've nearly forgotten who I am.

602
00:32:41,460 --> 00:32:42,820
Sometimes I even feel

603
00:32:43,540 --> 00:32:45,020
like I'm a teenager again.

604
00:32:46,060 --> 00:32:47,420
All I have to think about is
where to ride tomorrow,

605
00:32:47,980 --> 00:32:48,860
or where to watch cockfights.

606
00:32:49,700 --> 00:32:50,460
Nothing else to worry about.

607
00:32:53,940 --> 00:32:54,780
Being a teenager...

608
00:32:58,780 --> 00:32:59,660
Those days...

609
00:33:02,700 --> 00:33:03,580
I wouldn't want to go back.

610
00:33:21,020 --> 00:33:21,860
Easy now. Slowly!

611
00:33:21,980 --> 00:33:22,700
Come help us!

612
00:33:23,260 --> 00:33:23,780
Push!

613
00:33:23,780 --> 00:33:24,300
Push!

614
00:33:24,300 --> 00:33:24,940
Harder!

615
00:33:33,260 --> 00:33:34,060
Easy! Easy!

616
00:33:37,420 --> 00:33:38,100
What's going on?

617
00:33:39,060 --> 00:33:39,900
The carriage is stuck in a rut.

618
00:33:40,100 --> 00:33:40,380
Coming!

619
00:33:40,660 --> 00:33:41,420
There's room for one more here!

620
00:33:42,540 --> 00:33:44,900
One, two, three! Lift!

621
00:33:46,780 --> 00:33:47,260
Easy!

622
00:33:49,940 --> 00:33:50,740
Pull it back!

623
00:33:51,060 --> 00:33:51,860
Put some muscle into it!

624
00:33:51,860 --> 00:33:52,300
It won't budge!

625
00:33:52,300 --> 00:33:52,700
Further back!

626
00:33:52,820 --> 00:33:53,180
Push harder!

627
00:33:53,180 --> 00:33:54,020
The wheel's jammed!

628
00:33:56,980 --> 00:33:57,620
Give it some more effort!

629
00:33:59,460 --> 00:34:00,100
Where are we?

630
00:34:00,100 --> 00:34:01,020
You two, over there! Hurry!

631
00:34:01,420 --> 00:34:01,940
Lanyang.

632
00:34:02,180 --> 00:34:02,900
Put some rocks underneath.

633
00:34:03,220 --> 00:34:03,660
Where are the rocks?

634
00:34:04,100 --> 00:34:04,820
Coming! Here!

635
00:34:05,420 --> 00:34:06,700
(Lanyang, Hannan Circuit)

636
00:34:06,700 --> 00:34:07,260
From what I've seen along the way,

637
00:34:07,820 --> 00:34:08,460
this seems like a nice place.

638
00:34:09,180 --> 00:34:09,940
A little poor, perhaps,

639
00:34:11,380 --> 00:34:12,660
but the people seem honest and kind.

640
00:34:13,940 --> 00:34:14,780
Go sit over there for a while.

641
00:34:15,220 --> 00:34:15,860
We'll pull the carriage free.

642
00:34:16,540 --> 00:34:16,820
Hurry!

643
00:34:30,340 --> 00:34:30,940
(It can't be.)

644
00:34:32,500 --> 00:34:33,380
(It can't be that much
of a coincidence.)

645
00:35:05,340 --> 00:35:06,060
If it's someone you know,

646
00:35:06,660 --> 00:35:07,300
why not go say hello?

647
00:35:35,540 --> 00:35:35,820
Water!

648
00:35:36,140 --> 00:35:36,940
Any water yet?

649
00:35:37,700 --> 00:35:38,260
Dig another half a chi!

650
00:35:38,700 --> 00:35:39,300
Almost there!

651
00:35:48,660 --> 00:35:50,380
(He's put down roots here.)

652
00:35:52,140 --> 00:35:52,940
(That's a good thing.)

653
00:35:54,740 --> 00:35:56,060
(We've both settled into our own lives.)

654
00:35:57,420 --> 00:35:58,340
(That's good too.)

655
00:35:59,380 --> 00:36:00,100
(Mu Wanyao,)

656
00:36:01,340 --> 00:36:02,740
(isn't this exactly what you wanted?)

657
00:36:03,380 --> 00:36:03,820
Wait...

658
00:36:06,900 --> 00:36:07,740
Wanyao, look!

659
00:36:08,980 --> 00:36:10,340
Seriously! Wanyao, look!

660
00:36:49,900 --> 00:36:53,340
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

661
00:36:53,540 --> 00:36:56,940
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

662
00:36:57,180 --> 00:37:03,900
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

663
00:37:04,180 --> 00:37:06,140
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

664
00:37:06,140 --> 00:37:08,780
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

665
00:37:08,820 --> 00:37:11,380
♪You're the only one I need♪

666
00:37:11,420 --> 00:37:15,040
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

667
00:37:15,040 --> 00:37:18,580
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

668
00:37:18,660 --> 00:37:22,060
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

669
00:37:22,100 --> 00:37:25,460
♪My last untouched innocence♪

670
00:37:41,180 --> 00:37:45,860
♪Let me be the fireflies dancing
across your brow♪

671
00:37:48,100 --> 00:37:53,380
♪Let me hold you
whenever the rain falls♪

672
00:37:53,620 --> 00:37:57,620
♪- Together we'll soar to the skies;
- Together we'll turn to ashes♪

673
00:37:57,620 --> 00:37:59,600
♪Burning bright as a song♪

674
00:37:59,600 --> 00:38:03,340
♪Two shadows entwined,
a beautiful sight♪

675
00:38:03,580 --> 00:38:08,460
♪Be the vow I whisper again and again♪

676
00:38:08,540 --> 00:38:13,340
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

677
00:38:13,380 --> 00:38:15,220
♪Not a single hour less♪

678
00:38:15,300 --> 00:38:18,980
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

679
00:38:18,980 --> 00:38:22,980
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

680
00:38:23,140 --> 00:38:26,460
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

681
00:38:26,660 --> 00:38:30,180
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

682
00:38:30,340 --> 00:38:37,100
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

683
00:38:37,380 --> 00:38:39,260
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

684
00:38:39,260 --> 00:38:41,900
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

685
00:38:41,940 --> 00:38:44,500
♪You're the only one I need♪

686
00:38:44,540 --> 00:38:47,800
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

687
00:38:47,800 --> 00:38:51,700
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

688
00:38:51,780 --> 00:38:55,140
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

689
00:38:55,180 --> 00:38:58,620
♪My last untouched innocence♪

690
00:39:03,380 --> 00:39:04,740
Sir, what's wrong?

691
00:39:07,260 --> 00:39:07,780
Who's there?

692
00:39:19,060 --> 00:39:19,460
Sir,

693
00:39:20,140 --> 00:39:20,820
it's a...

694
00:39:20,820 --> 00:39:21,340
It's me.

695
00:39:21,900 --> 00:39:22,260
Yang Si.

696
00:39:25,220 --> 00:39:25,740
Yang Si,

697
00:39:26,980 --> 00:39:27,620
the Prince Consort?

698
00:39:28,900 --> 00:39:29,860
You're certainly well informed.

699
00:39:30,700 --> 00:39:31,500
After three years apart,

700
00:39:31,940 --> 00:39:33,260
I run into an old friend
as soon as I reach Lanyang.

701
00:39:33,860 --> 00:39:34,580
What a pleasant surprise.

702
00:40:00,340 --> 00:40:00,660
Sir.

703
00:40:11,380 --> 00:40:11,900
Your Highness,

704
00:40:12,780 --> 00:40:13,860
is someone else here?

705
00:40:18,100 --> 00:40:18,500
Yes.

706
00:40:19,660 --> 00:40:20,380
This is my maid.

707
00:40:22,660 --> 00:40:23,660
Well? Pay your respects
to Magistrate Yan.

708
00:40:29,020 --> 00:40:29,460
Sir,

709
00:40:29,780 --> 00:40:30,980
this lady is so beautiful!

710
00:40:31,420 --> 00:40:32,260
I've never seen anyone

711
00:40:32,380 --> 00:40:33,860
so pretty in all of Lanyang.

712
00:40:33,980 --> 00:40:34,340
Donglang.

713
00:40:35,060 --> 00:40:35,620
Mind your manners.

714
00:40:37,100 --> 00:40:39,020
Our county is suffering from a disaster.

715
00:40:40,020 --> 00:40:40,620
I can't offer much hospitality.

716
00:40:41,260 --> 00:40:42,220
I hope you'll forgive me, Your Highness.

717
00:40:43,300 --> 00:40:45,500
I think you owe me an apology
for more than that.

718
00:40:47,260 --> 00:40:47,580
Yes.

719
00:40:48,420 --> 00:40:49,780
I hope you'll forgive me, Your Highness.

720
00:40:50,420 --> 00:40:50,940
Not a chance.

721
00:40:52,380 --> 00:40:52,780
And another thing.

722
00:40:53,500 --> 00:40:54,420
Stop calling me that.

723
00:40:56,020 --> 00:40:56,460
All right.

724
00:40:57,620 --> 00:40:58,100
Yang Si.

725
00:41:08,740 --> 00:41:09,420
Seriously, though,

726
00:41:10,740 --> 00:41:11,620
what happened to your eyes?

727
00:41:17,260 --> 00:41:17,820
It's nothing.

728
00:41:19,380 --> 00:41:20,220
Just a little accident.

729
00:41:24,300 --> 00:41:25,020
What kind of accident?

730
00:41:25,660 --> 00:41:26,340
When did it happen?

731
00:41:27,500 --> 00:41:28,180
After you came to Lanyang?

732
00:41:32,740 --> 00:41:33,340
Wait, that's not right.

733
00:41:34,060 --> 00:41:34,980
Sir, have you forgotten?

734
00:41:35,260 --> 00:41:36,820
When you first came to Lanyang

735
00:41:36,820 --> 00:41:37,740
and bought me,

736
00:41:38,020 --> 00:41:39,180
you were already blind.

737
00:41:50,020 --> 00:41:51,300
Don't tell me you were already

738
00:41:52,020 --> 00:41:52,820
blind back in Sheng'an...

739
00:41:55,620 --> 00:41:56,300
It's all in the past.

740
00:41:57,020 --> 00:41:57,740
I barely remember it myself.

741
00:41:58,540 --> 00:41:59,820
How could you not remember?

742
00:41:59,820 --> 00:42:00,780
What kind of accident leaves you blind?

743
00:42:01,740 --> 00:42:02,300
Have you seen a doctor?

744
00:42:07,100 --> 00:42:08,300
Say something.

745
00:42:10,620 --> 00:42:11,100
I have,

746
00:42:12,780 --> 00:42:13,340
but there's no cure.

747
00:42:16,660 --> 00:42:17,300
Enough about that.

748
00:42:18,220 --> 00:42:19,260
You've come a long way, Yang Si.

749
00:42:19,660 --> 00:42:21,260
I ought to give you a proper welcome.

750
00:42:21,940 --> 00:42:22,260
Donglang,

751
00:42:22,980 --> 00:42:24,020
let's take our guests home.

752
00:42:26,020 --> 00:42:30,660
(Lanyang County Office)

753
00:42:58,060 --> 00:42:58,460
Donglang,

754
00:42:59,140 --> 00:42:59,660
go fetch some water.

755
00:43:00,100 --> 00:43:00,420
Sure.

756
00:43:29,660 --> 00:43:34,380
(Next Episode Preview)

757
00:43:34,420 --> 00:43:35,260
I promise you

758
00:43:35,540 --> 00:43:36,500
I'll set up offerings and an altar

759
00:43:37,340 --> 00:43:38,220
and perform a ritual

760
00:43:38,700 --> 00:43:39,540
to pray for rain in Lanyang.

761
00:43:40,300 --> 00:43:40,820
Yan Shang!

762
00:43:43,780 --> 00:43:44,260
Yan Shang!

763
00:43:51,280 --> 00:43:54,573
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

764
00:43:57,258 --> 00:44:02,174
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

765
00:44:04,368 --> 00:44:10,213
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

766
00:44:10,713 --> 00:44:15,939
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

767
00:44:18,708 --> 00:44:23,499
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

768
00:44:24,335 --> 00:44:30,414
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

769
00:44:32,215 --> 00:44:35,365
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

770
00:44:35,365 --> 00:44:37,013
♪Burning bright as a song♪

771
00:44:37,065 --> 00:44:40,789
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

772
00:44:41,167 --> 00:44:45,833
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

773
00:44:46,452 --> 00:44:50,493
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

774
00:44:50,984 --> 00:44:53,099
♪Not a single hour less♪

775
00:44:53,139 --> 00:45:00,085
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

776
